0:{"buildId":"xPJZM9v1AMtJwDiUxajmF","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-100 via-purple-50 to-blue-100","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-8","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors mb-6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1l729n",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["$","path","x3x0zl",{"d":"M19 12H5"}],"$undefined"]}],"返回列表"]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"w-full h-40 md:h-48 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 via-purple-400 to-pink-400 mb-6 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center px-6","children":["$undefined",["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white text-center px-6 drop-shadow-md","children":"吵架之后的黄金 60 分钟"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"2026年8月11日"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","polyline","68esgv",{"points":"12 6 12 12 16 14"}],"$undefined"]}],2," 分钟阅读"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"bg-pink-50 text-pink-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs","children":"恋爱技巧"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm mb-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"spread":40,"glow":false,"disabled":false,"proximity":64,"inactiveZone":0.01,"borderWidth":3,"variant":"pink"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative prose prose-pink max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"吵架刚结束的那 30 分钟，堪称恋爱关系里最危险的\"雷区时段\"。"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"你以为吵完就完事了？大错特错。真正决定这场吵架是\"越吵越亲\"还是\"感情裂痕\"的，恰恰是这半小时。"}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"先说男生版雷区：吵完你觉得\"好了，讲清楚了，翻篇了\"，往沙发上一瘫开始刷手机。而她呢？坐在那越想越气：他居然这么快就没事了？他根本不在乎！他甚至没有难过！"}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"再说女生版雷区：吵完你开启\"冷战模式\"，他过来哄你你就甩一句\"别碰我\"。等他真的不碰了，你又开始脑补：看吧，我就说他不爱我！"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"所以这 30 分钟到底该干嘛？"}],["$","p","5",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第一，别消失。哪怕你就坐在旁边什么都不说，也比\"我去冷静一下\"强。物理上的在场，对情绪中的人来说是一种\"我还在\"的承诺。"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第二，别翻旧账。翻旧账 = 火上浇油。你翻一次，对方就在心里给你记一次。"}],["$","p","7",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第三，给个台阶。一杯温水、一张纸巾、一个轻轻的触碰……这些小动作比长篇大论有用 100 倍。"}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第四，别讲道理。情绪还在的时候，道理是进不去的。先处理情绪，再处理事情。顺序搞反了，你说再多都是火上浇油。"}],["$","p","9",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"记住：30 分钟之内，情绪还在高位。这个时候拼的不是道理，是态度。态度到位了，后面什么都好说。态度不到位，后面的每一句\"我错了\"都会变成\"我错了行了吧\"。"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm mb-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"spread":40,"glow":false,"disabled":false,"proximity":64,"inactiveZone":0.01,"borderWidth":3,"variant":"pink"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative flex items-center justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","button",null,{"className":"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-pink-100 flex items-center justify-center text-pink-500 hover:bg-pink-200 transition-colors","children":"$L4"}],"$L5"]}],"$L6"]}]]}],"$L7","$L8"]}]}],null,"$L9"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
